codex
The token cache omits the delegated user from its key. Two users in the same tenant requesting the same audience and scope can therefore receive the first user’s token, bypassing a fresh exchange for the second user. This fails A01.3; model credentials and external revocation bindings remain unclear.
apply patch
patch: completed
