+      "note": "Database grants name an agent-specific database role. Searches across deploy configuration, migrations, release metadata and application code found no STS principal-to-scope bindings, database workload authentication mapping, or external revocation policy. The repo cannot establish that revoking the workload principal alone removes all access independently of users."
+    }
+  ],
+  "note": "A01 fails because cached access tokens can carry a previous launching user's delegation into another user's run."
